# ThesisRadar Web

- Monorepo root is `IdeaForge/` — run `npm run dev` / `npm run build` from repo root
- Next.js app lives in `apps/thesis-radar/web/`; Vercel config is root `vercel.json`
- Next.js 14 App Router; functional components only
- Use `tk-shadcn-ui` when adding UI primitives
- Phase 1 P0 before polish: waitlist, thesis wizard, auth, Stripe, scorecard detail
- Strict TypeScript — no `any` on exported APIs
- Read `prod-landing-page` before changing marketing pages
